    - target: {fileID: 2879168420635078504, guid: 0e6e4b04e036d884a89c20e9868502e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2879168420635078504, guid: 0e6e4b04e036d884a89c20e9868502e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.data[0]
      value: Battling isn't for those with a Speed stat slower than the game's credits.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2879168420635078504, guid: 0e6e4b04e036d884a89c20e9868502e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.data[1]
      value: You think innocence wins matches?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2879168420635078504, guid: 0e6e4b04e036d884a89c20e9868502e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.data[2]
      value: The wilderness is full of Level 10 bullies looking for an easy lunch.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2879168420635078504, guid: 0e6e4b04e036d884a89c20e9868502e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.data[3]
      value: Go eradicate every weakling in this zone until your hands are calloused
        and your level is respectable.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2879168420635078504, guid: 0e6e4b04e036d884a89c20e9868502e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.data[4]
      value: Only then will you have the privilege of... running away successfully.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
