      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2879168420635078504, guid: 0e6e4b04e036d884a89c20e9868502e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Halt! I\u2019m under strict orders to prevent obvious suicide missions."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2879168420635078504, guid: 0e6e4b04e036d884a89c20e9868502e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.data[1]
      value: Seeing your current Level, letting you through would count as a war
        crime
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2879168420635078504, guid: 0e6e4b04e036d884a89c20e9868502e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "I\u2019m not writing a three-page report explaining why a rookie turned
        into monster fertilizer"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2879168420635078504, guid: 0e6e4b04e036d884a89c20e9868502e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.data[3]
      value: See those scarecrows?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2879168420635078504, guid: 0e6e4b04e036d884a89c20e9868502e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.data[4]
      value: When you can actually beat one without your monster fainting from the
        effort,
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2879168420635078504, guid: 0e6e4b04e036d884a89c20e9868502e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.data[5]
      value: hen we can talk about you leaving.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2879168420635078504, guid: 0e6e4b04e036d884a89c20e9868502e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.data[6]
      value: "Until then, stay inside where it\u2019s safe and embarrassing.\""
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2879168420635078504, guid: 0e6e4b04e036d884a89c20e9868502e2, type: 3}
